  "question": "Which restaurant is the closest to the southwest of Canyon View Park, Afton, WY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-110.919483 42.731191)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 202.5 AND 247.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
